{#
  Injects src/_data/lenders.json as window.LENDERS for the page script on
  /bitcoin-lenders (same pattern as preferred-rates.njk → window.PREFERRED_RATES).
  The cards themselves are rendered by Nunjucks in bitcoin-lenders.njk; the
  script only recomputes trigger prices from the live bitcoin price, runs the
  filter chips and the reader's-own-LTV control, so the page is complete
  without JS. See SITE_GUIDE "Borrowing against bitcoin: the lenders".
#}
<script>window.LENDERS = {{ lenders | dump | safe }};</script>
